        "body": "Obligations climbed each year from $0 in FY21 to $275M in FY26. Growth accelerated after FY23, with obligations of $43.6M in FY23, $86.8M in FY24, $116M in FY25, and $275M in FY26. The company collected 52 awards in FY26 to date, and the average award size was $5.3M."
